      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s unfortunate that we haven\u0027t been able to land (at at least keep landed) the Pdfium change to allow Skia\u0027s use of Fontations in Pdfium, as that would make it obvious Chromium side that this change won\u0027t work (the Skia build in Chromium wouldn\u0027t even be able to link against FreeType, so the regression that this is would be caught).",
